			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10293301,
					"content": "阿丑，你說這矮堇瓜是不是睡著了？會做什麼夢啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10293302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荒瀧一斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 10293302,
					"content": "哞？哞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10293303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿丑"
				},
				{
					"id": 10293303,
					"content": "看她平常老是耀武揚威的，居然也有這麼沒精神的時候，唉…好可憐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10293304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荒瀧一斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 10293304,
					"content": "還有那個小哥，看著很疲憊。一個兩個，真叫人擔心啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10293305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荒瀧一斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 10293305,
					"content": "哞哞哞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10293306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿丑"
				},
				{
					"id": 10293306,
					"content": "我在牢房裡也這樣睡？你可真會開玩笑。本大爺的睡姿肯定是全世界最帥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10293307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荒瀧一斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 10293307,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}？！{F#妳}{M#你}什麼時候過來的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "荒瀧一斗"
				}
			]
		},
